    {
      "Text": "This update for openvpn fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-12932: memory leak using --tls-crypt-v2 (bsc#1273127).\n- CVE-2026-35058: improper validation of packet length can lead to a denial of service (bsc#1267945).\n",
